A '''Café Master''' (Japanese: '''マスター''' ''Master'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VIII]]. They are owners of [[Battle Café]]s located throughout [[Galar]]. They use Pokémon related to sweets, most of which are {{type|Fairy}} Pokémon. In Battle Cafés, Café Masters will face the {{player}} in a [[Double Battle]] whenever they use more than one Pokémon, and they can be [[rematch]]ed once a day. In the {{gal|Battle Tower}}, Café Masters specialize in {{t|Fire}}- and {{type|Ice}} Pokémon.

